@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home - ImageGallery</PageTitle>

<h2>Welcome to ImageGallery</h2>

<div class="info-section">
    <h3>REST API Documentation</h3>
    <p>This application provides a complete REST API for managing images. Access the API documentation:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="/swagger-ui" target="_blank">Swagger UI</a> - Interactive API documentation</li>
        <li><a href="/swagger" target="_blank">OpenAPI Specification</a> - YAML specification file</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Authentication</h3>
    <p>The API uses JWT Bearer token authentication. To use protected endpoints:</p>
    <ol>
        <li>Register a new user: <code>POST /api/auth/register</code></li>
        <li>Login to get a token: <code>POST /api/auth/login</code></li>
        <li>Include the token in requests: <code>Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN</code></li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Available Endpoints</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>POST</strong> /api/auth/register - Register new user</li>
        <li><strong>POST</strong> /api/auth/login - Login and get JWT token</li>
        <li><strong>GET</strong> /api/images - Get all images (public)</li>
        <li><strong>GET</strong> /api/images/my - Get current user's images (auth required)</li>
        <li><strong>GET</strong> /api/images/{id} - Get image details (public)</li>
        <li><strong>GET</strong> /api/images/{id}/file - Download image file (public)</li>
        <li><strong>POST</strong> /api/images/upload - Upload new image (auth required)</li>
        <li><strong>DELETE</strong> /api/images/{id} - Delete image (auth required, owner only)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Example Usage</h3>
    <pre><code># Register
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"testuser","password":"password123"}'

# Login
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"testuser","password":"password123"}'

# Upload Image
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/images/upload \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" \
  -F "title=My Photo" \
  -F "description=A beautiful sunset" \
  -F "file=@/path/to/image.jpg"

# Get All Images
curl http://localhost:8000/api/images</code></pre>
</div>

